          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Download the ACL 2025 LaTeX style files for paper submission. These are needed for an EMNLP 2026 via ACL Rolling Review submission.\n\nThe official repository is at https://github.com/acl-org/acl-style-files\n\nDownload the necessary .sty and .bst files to:\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_4/projects/collapse_severity_monitor/paper/\n\nThe key files needed are:\n- acl.sty (or acl2025.sty)\n- acl_natbib.bst (bibliography style)\n- Any other required .sty files\n\nUse wget or curl to download from the GitHub raw URLs. If that fails, try cloning the repo to a temp dir and copying files over.\n\nAfter downloading, verify the files exist and are non-empty."
            }
          ],
